# Q22 What is a Loading-Authorized Party, and how is it different from an Authorization object? (a role held for a period; the permission is a separate record)
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?definition WHERE {
  <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/party-role/loading-authorized-party> skos:definition ?definition .
  FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?definition), "allowed to lift product at a terminal") && CONTAINS(STR(?definition), "held for a period")
         && CONTAINS(STR(?definition), "the permission that grants it is a separate record"))
}
